S171 summand/multiplicand Farey additive-basis merge
==============================================================

[1] Fibonacci row arrangement
-----------------------------
row formula: row(n,k)=C(n-1-k,k), sum_k row(n,k)=F_n
n= 1 F_n=  1 row=1
n= 2 F_n=  1 row=1
n= 3 F_n=  2 row=1+1
n= 4 F_n=  3 row=1+2
n= 5 F_n=  5 row=1+3+1
n= 6 F_n=  8 row=1+4+3
n= 7 F_n= 13 row=1+5+6+1
n= 8 F_n= 21 row=1+6+10+4
n= 9 F_n= 34 row=1+7+15+10+1
n=10 F_n= 55 row=1+8+21+20+5
readout: the scalar F_n is a shadow; the row vector is the packet.

